## 23. Quick Reference Card

### Declarations

```
P name = value                              // Point (data / substrate)
D name = λ p . expr                         // Descriptor, single param, inline
D name = λ p, q . expr                      // Descriptor, multi-param, inline
D name = λ p . { ... → result }             // Descriptor, block body
T name = → if (cond) → { } → E { }         // Traverser, named conditional
```

### Literal Values

```
42                        // integer
3.14                      // float
"text\n"                  // string (\n = newline)
1  /  0                   // true / false (boolean)
(0 - n)                   // negative n — no negative literal syntax
manifold [a, b, c]        // ordered collection
manifold []               // empty collection
```

### Arithmetic

```
(a + b)    (a - b)    (a * b)    (a / b)    (a % b)
```

### Comparison

```
(a == b)    (a != b)    (a < b)    (a > b)    (a <= b)    (a >= b)
```

### Logic (ET arithmetic model)

```
(cond_a * cond_b)     // AND — multiplication of boolean values is conjunction
(1 - flag)            // NOT — complement of boolean
```

### Conditional (inline)

```
(if (condition) → then_val → E else_val)

// Chained else-if:
(if (a) → va → E (if (b) → vb → E vc))
```

### Loop (bound is MANDATORY)

```
∞ (
    // body — _loop_index available (starts at 0, increments each step)
) (D max_iterations)
```

### Common Loop Bounds

```
(D 144)      // MANIFOLD_SYMMETRY² — canonical ET bound for all series
(D 1000)     // general medium bound
(D 65536)    // string and buffer traversals (2¹⁶)
```

### Output

```
sovereign_print ∘ value
sovereign_print ∘ "text\n"
```

### Manifold

```
P arr = manifold [x, y, z]    // create
P val = arr[0]                 // read (zero-based index)
P arr[1] = new_val             // write (inside block body only)
```

### Hardware

```
hardware_access ∘ "operation"
hardware_access ∘ "operation" ∘ argument
```

### Comments

```
// single line comment
```

### ET Constants (always available)

```
MANIFOLD_SYMMETRY      = 12       // 3 primitives × 4 states
BASE_VARIANCE          = 1/12     // fundamental variance quantum
KOIDE_RATIO            = 2/3      // mass/charge coupling
WHILE_LOOP_FINITE_BOUND = 144     // 12² — default loop ceiling
```

### Incoherence — Know Your Contradictions

| Approaching Incoherence | What It Is | Prevention |
|---|---|---|
| Division by zero | `D_divisor=0 ⊕ D_quotient-defined` | T-guard before dividing |
| Out-of-bounds access | `D_size=n ⊕ D_access>n` | T-guard index before accessing manifold |
| Infinite loop | `(P∘D)_t = (P∘D)_{t-k}` | **Structurally impossible** — `(D n)` is mandatory |
| Negative square root | `D_real ⊕ D_negative-arg` | T-guard before calling `et_sqrt` |
| Type contradiction | `D_typeA ⊕ D_typeB` | Apply consistent Descriptors to each substrate |

**Grounding response for all Incoherences:**

```
T guard = → if (incoherence_approaching) → {
    → E safe_value    // ForceTraverse to E_safe, V(E) = 0
} → E P x = x
```

