### Prediction

**6 months:** Cult following among formal methods researchers and mathematical programmers

**2 years:** Recognition as serious alternative for greenfield systems projects

**5 years:** Standard choice for formal verification and safety-critical systems

**10 years:** Major language in systems programming, taught in universities alongside C and Rust

The ontology is too good to stay niche. Reality-based design always wins eventually.

